# {{ initial_app_name }} App Instructions

These instructions supplement the repository root `AGENTS.md` for work under
`apps/{{ initial_app_name }}/`.

## Scope

- Keep this app focused on its own domain. Project-wide configuration belongs in
  `config/`, not here.
- Keep this app's models,{% if use_shinobi %} API routes,{% endif %} background tasks, and tests co-located in this folder.

## Implementation Invariants

- Change models and add their migration in the same change; keep `make checkmigrations` clean.
{% if use_shinobi %}
- Keep API request/response shapes in `schemas.py` and bearer auth in `auth.py`; register routes in `api.py`.
{% endif %}
- Define background work with `django_tasks.task()` in `tasks.py`.
- Read configuration from the environment via `python-decouple`; never hardcode secrets.

## Validation

- Write or update tests before production code for behavior changes.
- Run `make test`, `make lint`, and `make typecheck` (or their `uv run` equivalents).
